## Recap
The party, having defeated the monstrous Beast of Bleasdale, found a hidden lake within its lair. A mysterious figure, clad in white, appeared and granted Caius a vision of his future.

## Atmosphere
The sun dips low, casting long shadows across the still water of the lake. The air is thick with the scent of damp earth and the faintest hint of blossoming flowers. A chill creeps in from the nearby hills, sending ripples across the surface of the water.

Caius stands on the bank, his gaze fixed on the mirror-like surface. He feels a strange connection to this place, a sense that he has been here before.

Elen approaches cautiously, her eyes scanning the lake's edge. She can feel the weight of unseen eyes upon her, a presence that seems to emanate from the water itself.

Peredur paces back and forth, his mind a whirl with questions. The figure in white had spoken cryptically, hinting at truths he yearns to understand.

